{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the enchanting world of <strong>Ploko</strong>, a relaxing VR experience where every model you build comes to life before your very eyes. With your camera, explore these miniature worlds, discover their hidden secrets and let your imagination run wild. Accompanied by an adorable cat, immerse yourself in an immersive and soothing journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525960/extras/BuildDioramas.gif?t=1740384170\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In the demo : </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lively city-themed demo model to assemble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden elements and secrets to discover with your polaroid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An endearing companion to follow you on your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accessories to embellish or make fun of your cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cosy, immersive atmosphere, perfect for relaxing</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525960?t=1740384170","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525960?t=1740384170","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525960/c7e4faa0e3c2444d6a697851409e897fcdcc73dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740384170","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525960/c7e4faa0e3c2444d6a697851409e897fcdcc73dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740384170","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the enchanting world of <strong>Ploko</strong>, a relaxing VR experience where every model you build comes to life